plaintext
* SPICE Netlist
* Independent voltage source
Vx 6 9 DC <Vx_value>

* Independent current source
Ix 9 2 DC <Ix_value>

* Voltage-controlled current source g_m*v1
Gm 5 2 2 2 <Gm_value>

* Resistor RD
RD 5 4 <RD_value>

* Resistor rO
RO 4 2 <RO_value>

* Voltage source V1 from 2 to ground
V1 2 0 DC <V1_value>

* Ground connection
V0 0 0 DC 0